wb-mqtt-waterius (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Exit with 7 when no devices are configured, without publishing a config error
  * Exit with 6 on every config read or parse error, with 2 on bad arguments
  * Wait for an unavailable MQTT broker instead of exiting; exit with 2 when the
    broker rejects the login
  * Report when the retained topics cannot be removed at stop because the broker
    is not connected; RestartSec=1, no restart on 2 and 6, 7 is a success
  * Require python3-wb-common >= 2.4.0 (MQTT client retry/wait API)

 -- Ekaterina Volkova <ekaterina.volkova@wirenboard.com>  Thu, 17 Sep 2026 16:11:39 +0000

wb-mqtt-waterius (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Daily send of Wiren Board meter readings to the waterius.ru cloud.
  * json-editor configuration schema for Settings -> Configuration files.

 -- Wiren Board Team <info@wirenboard.com>  Tue, 21 Jul 2026 18:59:00 +0000
